      "side": 1,
      "message": "[CL Review Agent] The `layersComputedWithPlugins` flag prevents re-computation of diff layers when the `path` or `diffElement` changes if the component is reused without a full reload. Since `GrDiffHost` can be updated with a new `path` through the `updated()` lifecycle method, this flag should be reset when the path changes to ensure that plugin layers are correctly re-created for the new file. Currently, if `layersComputedWithPlugins` is already true from a previous file, `computeLayersWithPlugins` will return early for any subsequent files if `reload()` (which calls `clear()`) is not invoked.",
      "revId": "e1661065182afa7a7096da98c121a6f3a1429705",
